er of the taxi world?\n\nTractor: \nDive into VR farming with Tractors & Fields VR: Virtual Farmer! Cultivate your land, plant crops, and harvest bountiful yields using realistic VR controls. Operate tractors, explore sprawling fields, and experience the beauty of virtual agriculture. From seed to supper, Tractors & Fields VR offers an immersive and rewarding experience for aspiring virtual farmers of all ages.", "short_description": "DriveVRX \u2013 All-in-One Driving Game offers the ultimate VR driving adventure! Drive a car, bus, truck, or tractor across city streets, highways, off-road trails, and parking zones. Multiple modes, realistic controls, and total immersion everything in one thrilling simulator!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25960523206949169"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827973_722660894264442_6846094607402804359_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PtDGbFFeM3wQ7kNvwHQ1AGX&_nc_oc=AdqwwXVSO9Ju51xqrdiV7LVQe1asq